This directory contains sanitized API response samples generated by the probe script.

Files are auto-generated when running:
  npm run probe -- --all

Sanitization rules:
- Field names, types, nesting, enum values, status strings, deadline formats are preserved
- PII values (names, emails, usernames) are replaced with deterministic placeholders [NAME_1], [EMAIL_1], [USERNAME_1]
- Numeric IDs are replaced with deterministic anonymous IDs (same real ID -> same anonymous ID across all files)
- Tokens are never logged or saved

These files are excluded from git (see .gitignore).
